# eats anything) start in the temple (3001); the fountain (3135) is in the Temple Square (3005), south. Objects: a
# water skin (3138, full of water), a bottle of firebreather (3003), an empty cup (3102), a bread (3011), a biscuit
# (3153), a poisoned chunk of meat (1305), two poisoned herbal brews (1351), an empty wineflask (3417, which can be
# held), and apples (918, pills, which Smokegod eats) with no spell, a bad spell number, and skills that aren't
# spells (sword, and kick, an offensive one). A second fountain and a cup with a bad liquid number (-1) are mended
# with a bug() line. Salt water can't make anyone thirsty: its -2 thirst rounds to 0 for any amount a cup holds.
